<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <h2>Your Resignation Has Been Approved</h2>
  <p>Dear {{employeeName}},</p>

  <p>Your resignation has been <strong>approved</strong> by {{approverName}}.</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Approved On:</strong> {{approvedDate}}</li>
    <li><strong>Last Working Day:</strong> {{approvedLastWorkingDay}}</li>
    <li><strong>Notice Period:</strong> {{noticePeriodDays}} days</li>
    {{#if remarks}}
      <li><strong>Remarks:</strong> {{remarks}}</li>
    {{/if}}
  </ul>

  <p>We thank you for your service and wish you all the best.</p>

  <p>Regards,<br />{{companyName}} Zuno HR</p>
</div>
